  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.5 cup butter, softened",
    "2 tablespoons fresh lemon zest",
    "2 large eggs",
    "1 tablespoon fresh lemon juice",
    "0.5 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1.75 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1.5 teaspoons baking powder",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "0.25 cup confectioners' sugar for rolling"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JYpoVV1yzmzi5oug4k2HjY2y0To=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-276680-lemon-cookies-from-scratch-ddmfs-step-1-d1925351150c42f697e3a86ac08cabb3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276680/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat together sugar, butter, and lemon zest in a large bowl using an electric mixer until light and fluffy, about 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iEuiZtSzbrAw-3EMspKbiPNvRSs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-276680-lemon-cookies-from-scratch-ddmfs-step-2-c0cb565cb9e74b69a69c4b173695305b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276680/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk together eggs, lemon juice, and vanilla in a small bowl until combined. Beat into butter mixture slowly on low speed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-cVPKTXIDgingB2QjpnAaZSeeS0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-276680-lemon-cookies-from-scratch-ddmfs-step-3-e99717c5e4804585901a1d31ca88538f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276680/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk together flour, baking powder, and salt in a medium bowl. Add to egg mixture slowly on low speed until just combined. Do not overbeat; dough will be sticky. Cover and chill dough in the refrigerator for 30 minutes; it will still be sticky after chilling.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oWVNuPOqDaNlBNZtv49caO-gFuM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-276680-lemon-cookies-from-scratch-ddmfs-step-4-b3d662da91a346778a041459ee968cbc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276680/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Line 2 baking sheets with parchment paper. Form dough into balls using a cookie scoop or tablespoon, then roll each in confectioners' sugar. Place 2 inches apart onto the prepared baking sheets. Lightly smash each ball down using your hand.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/X2jED_e0gNuXTRTIyvGPPlDD7gA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-276680-lemon-cookies-from-scratch-ddmfs-step-5-035c09c3051a48e09253ca8262943322.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276680/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until the centers are just barely set, 11 to 12 minutes. Let cool on a wire rack completely before storing in an airtight container.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EWqBmdFpQXW-RDCOH7gs8xWzXzo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-276680-lemon-cookies-from-scratch-ddmfs-step-6-a074751f854e4f9685229e27f7f34e8e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276680/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
